<title>USA: Cheektowage-Sloan UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Cheektowage-Sloan UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelet &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $6.600 million of Cheektowaga-Sloan UFSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net 5.1134 interest cost of percent.</p>
